Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: mips/filter_msa_intrinsics.c
Line: 482
Function: png_read_filter_row_sub4_msa
Bug type: out-of-bounds-write
CWE: CWE-787
Explanation: The loop processes 16-byte vectors without tail masking (count += 16 while count < istop-4), causing the last iteration to ST_UB 16 bytes even when fewer than 16 bytes remain, overwriting up to 15 bytes past the end of the row.

Source context:
